 "post": {
  "title": "AI runs my cold outreach",
  "caption": "Most people don't realize AI can run their entire cold outreach.\n\nDeepline plugs your AI agent into the whole go-to-market stack through one API. That covers data providers like Apollo and cold email infrastructure like Instantly, and it's usage-based pricing.\n\nSo you give your agent one prompt: find customers who match my ICP, check for recent buying signals, add them to an email campaign. It runs the whole thing end to end.\n\nComment CLAUDE and I'll send you the full setup guide for free.",
